# The installer the download page serves. 36 MB, rebuilt by CMake on every plug-in build,
# and git would keep every one of those copies forever -- it had already put four of them
# into the main repo's history before this rule existed.
#
# For a deployed site it belongs in Supabase Storage. The releases row already carries the
# size and SHA-256 that identify which build is current.
public/downloads/
